    (0x37A5B8, 0x4, 'shared-mutable', '0xC2FE0 (loading screen, "levelloadscreen") does fild [0x37A5B8] / fidiv [0x526AE0] to get the bar fraction (0xC2FE6/0xC2FFD) and clamps it to >= 0 (0xC302B/0xC3033). Every signon step (0x272D0, 0x282E0, 0x2CE20, 0x2E780, 0x30D80; each prints "PROGRESS BAR: changed status text") and the server\'s map load step it. Xbox UI / loading screen. Side effect: an added player\'s signon steps also move player 1\'s bar (cosmetic). [review 0]'),
